Academic integrity.

32
00:01:51.983 --> 00:01:55.283
Academic integrity means being honest in your schoolwork.

33
00:01:55.883 --> 00:01:58.127
Copying breaks academic integrity.

34
00:01:58.717 --> 00:02:01.857
Your turn. Say: Academic integrity.

35
00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.491
Academic integrity.

36
